        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86176, 8 Inch Urban Modern Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNew from Emtek, the Urban Modern 8 Inch Door Pull has a sleek design fro contemporary spaces. The  Urban Modern Door Handle is available in a wide array of popular finish colors. It will fit doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick and comes packaged with everything you'll need to thru-bolt mount it on a wood, fiberglass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86176-installed.jpg?v=1704354772\" align=\"right\" width=\"149\" height=\"327\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 86176 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-8-inch-urban-modern-door-pull-set-pair-emtek-btb-86176\"><b>Urban Modern Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Urban Modern Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
